{"id":"en_my-ex-regrets-after-i-married-the-dragon","title":"My Ex Regrets After I Married the Dragon","titleEn":"My Ex Regrets After I Married the Dragon","description":"Sairan's dragon pact is shattered, and the evil dragon demands a royal bride. When Elena refuses to enter the dragon valley and threatens to take her own life, Elodie steps in to replace her. She is fully aware that her betrothed, Henry, has eyes only for his stepsister Elena, and his constant favoritism toward Elena gradually extinguishes Elodie's love for him. On their wedding day, Henry raises the veil and finds Elena beneath it. It is only after Elodie is gone that he finally understands his true feelings have always belonged to her. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-ex-regrets-after-i-married-the-dragon/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-ex-regrets-after-i-married-the-dragon/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["All-Too-Late","Karma Payback","Love After Divorce","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-ex-regrets-after-i-married-the-dragon_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-ex-regrets-after-i-married-the-dragon_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-ex-regrets-after-i-married-the-dragon_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds65s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadabl